      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781247689566,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "let's see how we can setup the project and move forward with it \n\nsteps:\n1.Install django and drf \n[pip install django djangorestframework]\n\n2.create a project using django-admin cli\n[django-admin startproject project_name]\n\n3.enter into the project directory via cd\n[cd project_name]\n\n\n4.create the api folder / app via startapp command\n[python manage.py startapp api_name] ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "let's see how we can setup the project and move forward with it \n\nsteps:\n1.Install django and drf \n[pip install django djangorestframework]\n\n2.create a project using django-admin cli\n[django-admin startproject project_name]\n\n3.enter into the project directory via cd\n[cd project_name]\n\n\n4.create the api folder / app via startapp command\n[python manage.py startapp api_name] ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
