    {
      "id": "bUOhs2f97DyTZ_CNuH4cv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 342.68570105602635,
      "y": 4641.716065597491,
      "width": 748,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1103141047,
      "version": 102,
      "versionNonce": 551980919,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781248518951,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now let's add real database to the django-drf project and see how it\nworks",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now let's add real database to the django-drf project and see how it\nworks",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gxcs8-0M9IOXzbRFq0l6_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 319.8335415936099,
      "y": 4768.065154234515,
      "width": 692.98828125,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1157807417,
      "version": 33,
      "versionNonce": 732626935,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781248539164,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now replace the in-memory list with PostgreSQL (or SQLite for\nlocal dev). This introduces the Model → Serializer → View → URL\npattern that Django enforces.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now replace the in-memory list with PostgreSQL (or SQLite for local dev). This introduces the Model → Serializer → View → URL pattern that Django enforces.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mm_SRp-Ij_xFPEmXmeamc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 339.3781436754159,
      "y": 4716.81189305989,
      "width": 693,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1174842935,
      "version": 58,
      "versionNonce": 1554138201,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781248551860,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. CRUD API with a real database\n\nNow replace the in-memory list with PostgreSQL (or SQLite for\nlocal dev). This introduces the Model → Serializer → View → URL\npattern that Django enforces.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. CRUD API with a real database\n\nNow replace the in-memory list with PostgreSQL (or SQLite for local dev). This introduces the Model → Serializer → View → URL pattern that Django enforces.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "L8T6JPqvd9Hx1ySUisewF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 343.03465666952025,
      "y": 4875.782306939106,
      "width": 659.9921875,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 300533751,
      "version": 32,
      "versionNonce": 1603935769,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781248564193,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The four-layer pattern\n\nRequest\n   ↓\nurls.py         — maps URL + method to a view function\n   ↓\nviews.py        — reads request.data, calls ORM, returns\nResponse\n   ↓\nserializers.py  — converts ORM objects ↔ Python dicts ↔ JSON\n   ↓\nmodels.py       — describes the database table\n   ↓\nDatabase (Postgres / SQLite)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The four-layer pattern\n\nRequest\n   ↓\nurls.py         — maps URL + method to a view function\n   ↓\nviews.py        — reads request.data, calls ORM, returns Response\n   ↓\nserializers.py  — converts ORM objects ↔ Python dicts ↔ JSON\n   ↓\nmodels.py       — describes the database table\n   ↓\nDatabase (Postgres / SQLite)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
