    {
      "id": "b_4kVJaG8IaxgRyXWRFv0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 329.6247333435184,
      "y": 6644.887504103538,
      "width": 921.4160203980327,
      "height": 250,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ac",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 141603097,
      "version": 252,
      "versionNonce": 1011874327,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781248907674,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Serializer vs ModelSerializer\n\nA Serializer does two jobs:\n\n\n1.Deserialization — validates incoming JSON and converts it to Python data / model\ninstances.\n\n2.Serialization — converts model instances (or querysets) to Python dicts that DRF\nrenders as JSON.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Serializer vs ModelSerializer\n\nA Serializer does two jobs:\n\n\n1.Deserialization — validates incoming JSON and converts it to Python data / model instances.\n\n2.Serialization — converts model instances (or querysets) to Python dicts that DRF renders as JSON.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MPo327_MhH0RGlJEq_IM9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 328.2503223357593,
      "y": 6926.978041136545,
      "width": 627,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ad",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1783321465,
      "version": 80,
      "versionNonce": 1168019545,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781248909941,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "There are two ways to write one.\n\n4a. Serializer — the manual way\n\nYou declare every field explicitly. Gives maximum control",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "There are two ways to write one.\n\n4a. Serializer — the manual way\n\nYou declare every field explicitly. Gives maximum control",
      "autoResize": true,
